{"suttaId":"snp5.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Sn","vriCode":"s0505m.mul","paras":[3566,3594],"vripara":"1049"},"segments":{"snp5.4:0.2":"Puṇṇakamāṇavapucchā","snp5.4:1.1":"“Anejaṃ mūladassāviṃ,","snp5.4:1.2":"(iccāyasmā puṇṇako)","snp5.4:1.3":"Atthi [atthī (syā.)] pañhena āgamaṃ;","snp5.4:1.4":"Kiṃ nissitā isayo manujā,","snp5.4:1.5":"khattiyā brāhmaṇā devatānaṃ;","snp5.4:1.6":"Yaññamakappayiṃsu puthūdha loke,","snp5.4:1.7":"pucchāmi taṃ bhagavā brūhi me taṃ”.","snp5.4:2.1":"“Ye kecime isayo manujā,","snp5.4:2.2":"(puṇṇakāti bhagavā)","snp5.4:2.3":"Khattiyā brāhmaṇā devatānaṃ;","snp5.4:2.4":"Yaññamakappayiṃsu puthūdha loke,","snp5.4:2.5":"āsīsamānā puṇṇaka itthattaṃ [itthabhāvaṃ (sī. syā.)];","snp5.4:2.6":"Jaraṃ sitā yaññamakappayiṃsu”.","snp5.4:3.1":"“Ye kecime isayo manujā,","snp5.4:3.2":"(iccāyasmā puṇṇako)","snp5.4:3.3":"Khattiyā brāhmaṇā devatānaṃ;","snp5.4:3.4":"Yaññamakappayiṃsu puthūdha loke,","snp5.4:3.5":"kaccissu te bhagavā yaññapathe appamattā;","snp5.4:3.6":"Atāruṃ jātiñca jarañca mārisa,","snp5.4:3.7":"pucchāmi taṃ bhagavā brūhi me taṃ”.","snp5.4:4.1":"“Āsīsanti thomayanti, abhijappanti juhanti;","snp5.4:4.2":"(Puṇṇakāti bhagavā)","snp5.4:4.3":"Kāmābhijappanti paṭicca lābhaṃ,","snp5.4:4.4":"te yājayogā bhavarāgarattā;","snp5.4:4.5":"Nātariṃsu jātijaranti brūmi”.","snp5.4:5.1":"“Te ce nātariṃsu yājayogā,","snp5.4:5.2":"(iccāyasmā puṇṇako)","snp5.4:5.3":"Yaññehi jātiñca jarañca mārisa;","snp5.4:5.4":"Atha ko carahi devamanussaloke,","snp5.4:5.5":"atāri jātiñca jarañca mārisa;","snp5.4:5.6":"Pucchāmi taṃ bhagavā brūhi me taṃ”.","snp5.4:6.1":"“Saṅkhāya lokasmi paroparāni [parovarāni (sī. syā.)],","snp5.4:6.2":"(puṇṇakāti bhagavā)","snp5.4:6.3":"Yassiñjitaṃ natthi kuhiñci loke;","snp5.4:6.4":"Santo vidhūmo anīgho nirāso,","snp5.4:6.5":"atāri so jātijaranti brūmī”ti.","snp5.4:6.6":"Puṇṇakamāṇavapucchā tatiyā niṭṭhitā."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Pj-ii","bookName":"Suttanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0505a.att","from":2542,"to":2546,"paras":[{"para":2542,"vripara":"1050","refs":["snp5.4:2"],"lines":["<b>Anejan</b>ti puṇṇakasuttaṃ.","Imampi purimanayeneva mogharājānaṃ paṭikkhipitvā vuttaṃ.","Tattha <b>mūladassāvin</b>ti akusalamūlādidassāviṃ.","<b>Isayo</b>ti isināmakā jaṭilā.","<b>Yaññan</b>ti deyyadhammaṃ.","<b>Akappayiṃsū</b>ti pariyesanti."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"]]},{"para":2543,"vripara":"1051","refs":["snp5.4:2"],"lines":["<b>Āsīsamānā</b>ti rūpādīni patthayamānā.","<b>Itthattan</b>ti itthabhāvañca patthayamānā, manussādibhāvaṃ icchantāti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Jaraṃ sitā</b>ti jaraṃ nissitā.","Jarāmukhena cettha sabbavaṭṭadukkhaṃ vuttaṃ.","Tena vaṭṭadukkhanissitā tato aparimuccamānā eva kappayiṃsūti dīpeti."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"]]},{"para":2544,"vripara":"1052","refs":["snp5.4:2"],"lines":["<b>Kaccissu te bhagavā yaññapathe appamattā, atāruṃ jātiñca jarañca mārisā</b>ti ettha yaññoyeva yaññapatho.","Idaṃ vuttaṃ hoti – kacci te yaññe appamattā hutvā yaññaṃ kappayantā vaṭṭadukkhamatariṃsūti."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"]]},{"para":2545,"vripara":"1053","refs":["snp5.4:2","snp5.4:5"],"lines":["<b>Āsīsantī</b>ti rūpapaṭilābhādayo patthenti.","<b>Thomayantī</b>ti “suyiṭṭhaṃ suci dinnan”tiādinā nayena yaññādīni pasaṃsanti.","<b>Abhijappantī</b>ti rūpādipaṭilābhāya vācaṃ bhindanti.","<b>Juhantī</b>ti denti.","<b>Kāmābhijappanti paṭicca lābhan</b>ti rūpādipaṭilābhaṃ paṭicca punappunaṃ kāme eva abhijappanti,“aho vata amhākaṃ siyun”ti vadanti, taṇhañca tattha vaḍḍhentīti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Yājayogā</b>ti yāgādhimuttā.","<b>Bhavarāgarattā</b>ti evamimehi āsīsanādīhi bhavarāgeneva rattā, bhavarāgarattā vā hutvā etāni āsīsanādīni karontā <b>nātariṃsu</b> jātiādivaṭṭadukkhaṃ na uttariṃsūti."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:2"],["snp5.4:5"],["snp5.4:5"]]},{"para":2546,"vripara":"1054-1055","refs":["snp5.4:5","snp5.4:6"],"lines":["1054-5. <b>Athakocarahī</b>ti atha idāni ko añño atārīti.","<b>Saṅkhāyā</b>ti ñāṇena vīmaṃsitvā.","<b>Paroparānī</b>ti parāni ca orāni ca, parattabhāvasakattabhāvādīni parāni ca orāni cāti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Vidhūmo</b>ti kāyaduccaritādidhūmavirahito.","<b>Anīgho</b>ti rāgādiīghavirahito.","<b>Atāri so</b>ti so evarūpo arahā jātijaraṃ atāri.","Sesamettha pākaṭameva."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.4:5"],["snp5.4:6"],["snp5.4:6"],["snp5.4:6"],["snp5.4:6"],["snp5.4:6"],["snp5.4:6"]]}],"wordLinks":[["snp5.4:2.1","isayo",0,3],["snp5.4:2.4","yaññaṃ",0,4],["snp5.4:2.6","yaññaṃ",0,4],["snp5.4:2.4","akappayiṃsū",0,5],["snp5.4:2.6","akappayiṃsū",0,5],["snp5.4:5.1","yājayogā",3,5],["snp5.4:5.1","nātariṃsu",3,6],["snp5.4:6.1","saṅkhāyā",4,1],["snp5.4:6.1","paroparānī",4,2],["snp5.4:6.4","vidhūmo",4,3],["snp5.4:6.4","anīgho",4,4],["snp5.4:6.4","atāri so",4,5]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
